        advanced {
            postText:
                ```html
                <div id="weekly_box">
                    <div class="days" id='SUN'>S</div>
                    <div class="days" id='MON'>M</div>
                    <div class="days" id='TUE'>T</div>
                    <div class="days" id='WED'>W</div>
                    <div class="days" id='THU'>T</div>
                    <div class="days" id='FRI'>F</div>
                    <div class="days" id='SAT'>S</div>
                </div>
                <div id="monthly_box">
                    <table>
                       <tr><td class="date" id='1'>1</td> <td class="date" id='2'>2</td> <td class="date" id='3'>3</td><td class="date" id='4'>4</td><td class="date" id='5'>5</td><td class="date" id='6'>6</td><td class="date" id='7'>7</td></tr>
                <tr><td class="date" id='8'>8</td> <td class="date" id='9'>9</td><td class="date" id='10'>10</td><td class="date" id='11'>11</td><td class="date" id='12'>12</td><td class="date" id='13'>13</td> <td class="date" id='14'>14</td></tr>
                <tr><td class="date" id='15'>15</td><td class="date" id='16'>16</td><td class="date" id='17'>17</td><td class="date" id='18'>18</td><td class="date" id='19'>19</td><td class="date" id='20'>20</td><td class="date" id='21'>21</td></tr>
                <tr><td class="date" id='22'>22</td><td class="date" id='23'>23</td><td class="date" id='24'>24</td><td class="date" id='25'>25</td> <td class="date" id='26'>26</td> <td class="date" id='27'>27</td><td class="date" id='28'>28</td></tr>
                        <tr><td class="date" id='29'>29</td><td class="date" id='30'>30</td><td class="date" id='31'>31</td> <td colspan="4" style="text-align: right;"><input type='button' value="OK" id="date_button"></td> </tr>
                    </table> 
                </div>
                
                <div id='mothly_schedue_value' style="display:none"> Dates <span></span></div>
                ```
